    genel: "When the 3rd energy appears in the yearly cycle, the birth of a child can often be foreseen; in some cases even signs about the child's gender can be sensed. If the woman's energy is in a positive feminine flow, a girl may be born; if the energy carries more of a masculine quality, a soft-natured boy may come into the world. If a birth is not in question, the 3rd energy this time speaks of a creation, a new project; this is the woman's time for self-expression. During this period, creating an atmosphere full of comfort and abundance at home, taking care of yourself, dressing up, and tending to plants and pets carry great importance. In social relationships and every form of communication, it is necessary to openly display your feminine nature, shaping your behavior nourished by this nature; expressing your feminine nature more clearly stands out as the year's biggest task for the 3rd energy. In men's matrix, the 3rd energy symbolizes that a woman will enter their life. For a single man in search of a partner, the chance of finding his spouse within this year is quite high. It is recommended that the man show more attention and care to his partner, thereby strengthening his own good masculine qualities.",
