    genel: "If the 10th energy is present in the yearly cycle, a year awaits you in which turning-point events will happen and fate will be distinctly felt, because the 10th energy is the energy of luck; so be ready to accept the gifts coming from the outside world. Do not refuse any gift offered to you, accept it with gratitude even if you do not feel you deserve it. Significant gain can be expected this year, perhaps even an award or a chance at winning a lottery; so buying a lottery ticket may even make sense. Try to approach everything with lightness and a positive point of view, think only positive things. Offer your wishes to the universe and release them, do not dwell on them too much. Pay attention to the signs the universe sends you: it could be a phone call from a friend, an invitation, an advertising poster, or a song playing on the radio; the universe gives you the answer to your questions this way. When you catch your luck, do not be selfish, share it with others; taking part in charity projects is encouraged. This year you should socialize more, travel more, and do these with an inner ease, without experiencing tension. Your friends could become your business partner, or you could meet the love of your life within your circle of friends.",
