  12: "This energy brings the theme of helpfulness, building balance and transformation to the atmosphere of the year; supporting others, getting rid of old habits, or moving forward with creative ideas may come to the forefront during this period. On the other hand, excessive self-sacrifice, indecision, or a lack of motivation may also be the challenging side of this year. It is recommended that you leave the past behind and move forward without neglecting yourself either.",
  13: "The general theme of the year is transformation and restructuring; a job change, moving, the ending of a harmful relationship, or financial restructuring may come up during this period. At the same time, confronting losses, job loss, or health problems are also aspects of this year that require attention. Being open to change and not neglecting your health will help you get through this transitional period more easily.",
  14: "This energy brings the theme of balance, peace and creativity to the atmosphere of the year; artistic achievements, an increase in income, and stability in relationships may come to the forefront during this period. But tendencies toward addiction, sudden material losses, or risks of excessive attachment may also form the aspect of this year that requires attention. It is recommended that you preserve your balance through meditation or spiritual practices, and manage your budget carefully.",
