  7: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), activity and progress come to the forefront; you may travel, and you may find the chance to settle into a new home or city. You may take on an important project, and your chance of starting a new business or getting a promotion is high. But low energy, unexpected accidents, or the tension brought by competition also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Plan your projects well during this period and act by weighing your risks." },
  8: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), an ongoing lawsuit may conclude in your favor, or an old debt may be closed. You may reap the fruits of work you have long been engaged in during these months, and you may receive a payment you deserve. But legal processes or disputes may also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Carefully review your documents during this period and fulfill your responsibilities on time." },
  9: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), the desire to turn inward and find your inner peace may strengthen; you may set aside time for your individual growth and discover new interests. You may gain freedom through freelance ways of working. But a decrease in income or a tendency to withdraw are also aspects of this period that require attention.", tavsiye: "Manage your resources carefully during this period and preserve your bond with your loved ones." },
  10: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), many new doors may open before you; you may go through a lucky period and meet people who are genuinely beneficial to you. An unexpected material gain or the payment of your debts is also possible in these months. But matters from the past coming up again also require attention.", tavsiye: "Evaluate opportunities calmly and rationally during this period." },
