  12: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), you may find opportunities to support others or be useful to those around you. You may get rid of old habits and set new goals. But excessive self-sacrifice or a lack of motivation also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Do not neglect yourself while supporting others during this period." },
  13: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), a job change, starting a new project, or a promotion may come up. Positive changes may begin with the ending of a relationship that is not good for you. But confronting losses or the risk of job loss also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Be open to change during this period and do not neglect your health." },
  14: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), you may achieve success in new projects or artistic work. An increase in income or becoming financially balanced may be in question. But sudden material losses or tendencies toward addiction also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Preserve your balance through meditation or spiritual practices during this period." },
