  17: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), your work and your achievements may be appreciated; you may successfully complete a school, a course, or an education. You may rise in your work life. But unexpected criticism or disappointments also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Set realistic goals during this period and carefully evaluate the new people you meet." },
