  20: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), you may achieve an important material gain, such as a large inheritance. A new family member joining may come up. But issues from the past coming up again also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Focus on resolving old problems with determination during this period." },
  21: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), opportunities for travel and discovering new places may arise; you may gain recognition and popularity. The chance to find your soulmate or build a meaningful connection is also possible. But a feeling of restriction or postponed plans also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Step into new opportunities by trusting yourself during this period." },
  22: { icerik: "In the first period of the year (January-April), the opportunity to start a new job, education, or career may arise. A new partner, friend, or connection may enter your life. But unexpected restrictions or unclear promises also require attention during this period.", tavsiye: "Pay attention to details during this period and avoid quick decisions." }
